    ],
    "text": "ORDER UNDER ARTICLE 10 OF SCHEDULE \u2018E\u2019 OF THE CUSTOMS (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 2 OF 2003",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      372.97,
      546.83,
      408.04
    ],
    "text": "IN pursuance of the powers vested in me by Article 10 of Schedule \u2018E\u2019 of the Customs (Amendment) Act, No. 2 of 2003,I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance, do hereby order to amend the Gazette Notification No. 1933/ 16 of22nd September 2015 as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      105.21,
      417.13,
      546.87,
      440.2
    ],
    "text": "(1) The order made in the Gazette Notification No. 1933/16 of 22nd September 2015 shall be in force from19th October 2015 and continued to be in force until further notice.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      105.21,
      453.13,
      546.88,
      512.2
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Gazette Notification No. 1901/ 3 of 10th February 2015, published under Article 10 of Schedule\u2018\u2018E\u201d of the Customs (Amendment) Act, No. 2 of 2003 is hereby repealed with effect from 18th October2015. However for the purpose of determination of Customs value of motor vehicles, imported based onthe Letter of Credit (s) established on or before 18th October 2015 and not amended subsequently, theGazette Notification No. 1901/ 3 dated 10th February 2015 shall be deemed to be in effect and applicable.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
